units real
atom_style full

boundary p p p

pair_style lj/cut 12.0

bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style zero nocoeff
improper_style harmonic

special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.5

read_data minimized.data

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep 0.25

thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal ebond eangle edihed eimp evdwl press


log heating.log

reset_timestep 0

velocity all create 200 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix 1 all nvt temp 200 200 100.0

thermo 100

dump 1 all custom 100 heating.xyz id type x y z

dump_modify 1 sort id

run 200000

write_data heated.data

unfix 1
